1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:04,400
When the priority changes at four, the test is not speed.

2
00:00:04,350 --> 00:00:06,162
It is ownership.

3
00:00:06,162 --> 00:00:09,525
First, name what is still in your control.

4
00:00:09,525 --> 00:00:14,162
Your next sentence, your next estimate, and your next clean handoff.

5
00:00:14,162 --> 00:00:17,912
Second, do not punish the room with your frustration.

6
00:00:17,912 --> 00:00:20,487
Pressure is already expensive.

7
00:00:20,487 --> 00:00:22,725
Do not add interest.

8
00:00:22,725 --> 00:00:26,437
Third, choose the smallest honest next action.

9
00:00:26,437 --> 00:00:28,212
One message.

10
00:00:28,212 --> 00:00:30,587
One revised deadline.

11
00:00:30,587 --> 00:00:32,662
One visible step.

12
00:00:32,662 --> 00:00:35,712
The Stoic move is not to feel nothing.

13
00:00:35,712 --> 00:00:38,950
It is to stop making surprise your excuse.

14
00:00:38,950 --> 00:00:44,550
When work changes late, become the calmest person who tells the truth and keeps moving.

15
00:00:44,550 --> 00:00:49,962
Subscribe to @stoic-modernized for practical Stoic tools you can use at work.

